{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12939","headline":"三月三日自京到华阴於水亭独酌寄裴六薛八 · 独孤及","name":"三月三日自京到华阴於水亭独酌寄裴六薛八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祗役匪遑息，经时客三秦。\n还家问节候，知到上巳辰。\n山县何所有，高城闭青春。\n和风不吾欺，桃杏满四邻。\n旧友适远别，谁当接欢欣。\n呼儿命长瓢，独酌湘吴醇。\n一酌一朗咏，既酣意亦申。\n言筌暂两忘，霞月祗相新。\n裴子尘表物，薛侯席上珍。\n寄书二傲吏，何日同车茵。\n讵肯使空名，终然羁此身。\n他年解桎梏，长作海上人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}